LIMITATIONS

This project is a research-grade prototype for quantitative risk modeling.

Key limitations:
- Data is not production-grade or audited
- Models are for research and experimentation only
- No guarantees of predictive accuracy in live markets
- Backtests may suffer from survivorship bias or data leakage risks if not carefully controlled
- Risk metrics (VaR, stress tests) are simplified implementations
- ML regime classification is exploratory and not production validated
